GATE="shellcheck"
EXPECT_EXIT="1"
EXPECT_RULE="SC2164"
DESCRIPTION="Also asserts a denominator, so a gate that finds the planted defect while quietly analysing a smaller set still fails. An unchecked cd must be caught and attributed to SC2164 specifically. The first version of this fault expected SC2086 (unquoted expansion) and passed green, because SC2086 is info-level and the gate runs at severity>=warning -- the fault was testing a rule the gate was configured not to report. Asserting the code caught that; asserting only the exit status would not have."
EXPECT_SCANNED_MIN="1"
